  "question": "判断级数 $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} (-1)^n \\frac{n^{n+1}}{(n+1)!}$ 的敛散性.",
  "answer": "发散.",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "绝对收敛判别",
    "莱布尼兹准则"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 交错级数，先考虑绝对收敛性."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "考察 $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}|u_n| = \\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{n^{n+1}}{(n+1)!}$ ."
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "因为"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "$$\n\\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac {\\left| u _ {n + 1} \\right|}{\\left| u _ {n} \\right|} = \\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac {(n + 1) ^ {n + 2}}{(n + 2) !} \\cdot \\frac {(n + 1) !}{n ^ {n + 1}} = \\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\left(1 + \\frac {1}{n}\\right) ^ {n} \\frac {(n + 1) ^ {2}}{n (n + 2)} = e > 1,\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "所以原级数不绝对收敛."
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "由 $\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}\\frac{|u_{n + 1}|}{|u_n|} >1$ 知，当 $n$ 充分大时，有 $|u_{n + 1}| > |u_n| > 0$ ，故 $\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}|u_n|\\neq 0$ ，即 $\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}u_n\\neq 0$ .所以原级数发散."
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "发散.",
    "techniques_used": [
      "绝对收敛判别",
      "莱布尼兹准则"
    ]
  },
